    "description": "Covers the Blog resource: multipart image upload, the Nodemailer confirmation, role-based access, validation, the image lifecycle, pagination and search.\n\nBefore running:\n  1. `npm install`\n  2. `npm run make:admin -- admin@example.com` (so request 1.3 works)\n  3. Set EMAIL_USER / EMAIL_PASS in .env for real mail; leave them blank and the API still works, reporting notification.sent = false\n  4. Run the folders top to bottom — later requests reuse variables (ownerToken, blogId, imageUrl) captured by earlier ones\n\nFolders 2.1, 6.1 and 7.1 need a file attached by hand; pick any small PNG.",
